0% packet loss
```

This confirms hostname resolution and ICMP connectivity.

**Screenshot:** `Screenshots/21-android-dns.png`

# 26. Step 23: Verify Kali DNS Resolution

On Kali:

```bash
ping -I eth0 -c 4 google.com
```

Expected:

```text
PING google.com (resolved-ip)

4 packets transmitted
4 received
0% packet loss
```

This confirms DNS resolution and internet connectivity from Kali.

**Screenshot:** `Screenshots/22-kali-dns.png`

